{
  "id": "io.github.parieses.formatter",
  "name": "代码格式化",
  "version": "1.0.2",
  "description": "通用代码压缩/美化（JS / CSS / HTML 自动检测）与 SQL 格式化合二为一",
  "author": "QuickDock",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "category": "开发者日常",
  "platforms": [
    "windows"
  ],
  "backend": {
    "runtime": "goja",
    "entry": "main.js"
  },
  "frontend": {
    "enabled": true,
    "entry": "frontend/index.html",
    "width": 680,
    "height": 520
  },
  "commands": [
    {
      "id": "code-minify",
      "title": "代码压缩 (Minify)",
      "keywords": [
        "minify",
        "compress",
        "uglify",
        "缩小",
        "压缩代码"
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "压缩",
        "代码压缩",
        "js压缩",
        "css压缩",
        "html压缩"
      ],
      "matchPattern": "^\\s*(function|var |let |const |import|export|<html|<div|<script|<style)",
      "prefix": "/minify",
      "acceptsInput": true,
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "代码压缩 (Minify)",
        "en-US": "Minify Code"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-prettify",
      "title": "代码美化 (Prettify)",
      "keywords": [
        "prettify",
        "beautify",
        "format",
        "美化",
        "格式化代码"
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "美化",
        "代码美化",
        "格式化"
      ],
      "prefix": "/prettify",
      "acceptsInput": true,
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "代码美化 (Prettify)",
        "en-US": "Prettify Code"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "format-sql",
      "title": "SQL 格式化",
      "keywords": [
        "sql",
        "format",
        "beautify",
        "pretty"
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "sql格式化",
        "美化sql",
        "sql美化",
        "sql整理"
      ],
      "matchPattern": "^\\s*(SELECT|INSERT|UPDATE|DELETE|CREATE|ALTER|DROP|WITH|TRUNCATE|MERGE|CALL|EXEC|BEGIN|DECLARE|SET|SHOW|DESCRIBE|EXPLAIN)\\b",
      "prefix": "/sql",
      "acceptsInput": true,
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "SQL 格式化",
        "en-US": "Format SQL"
      }
    }
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "command",
    "frontend"
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "clipboard": true
  },
  "name_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "代码格式化",
    "en-US": "Code Formatter"
  },
  "description_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "通用代码压缩/美化（JS / CSS / HTML 自动检测）与 SQL 格式化合二为一",
    "en-US": "Universal code minify/beautify (JS/CSS/HTML auto-detect) plus SQL formatting in one tool."
  },
  "changelog": "## v1.0.2\n\n- 50 个插件的图形全部按各自功能重新绘制（原先是从老仓库图形迁移过来的通用件）\n- 统一的部分：64 网格 / 安全区 / 最粗一笔 3px / 同色系渐变底色 / 深浅两档主题\n- 浅色档 icon.light.svg 重做：白底贴片 + 品牌色描边圈 + 品牌色字形，与深色档（渐变贴片 + 白字）肉眼可辨地区分（原先两档只差色号，看起来一模一样）\n- 不同的部分：字形本体，逐个对应插件功能（如 mail-check 为信封+对勾、jwt-decoder 为三段的凭证、unit-converter 为标尺+双向箭头）\n- 保留状态语义的强调色：绿 = 可用 / 生效 / 通过，红 = 删除，黄 = 告警\n- 图形源改为 glyphs.py 单点维护，改了重跑 glyphs.py + gen_icons.py --gen 即可\n\n\n## v1.0.1\n\n- 图标改用统一 64 网格满幅圆角贴片 + 白色图形，线宽归一\n- 新增浅色主题图标 `icon.light.svg`，随应用主题自动切换\n\n## v1.0.0\n\n- 通用代码压缩/美化（JS / CSS / HTML 自动检测）与 SQL 格式化合二为一\n"
}
